{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for iOS 16 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Receiving","type":"text"}]},{"text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presenting"}]},{"type":"text","text":" them in answer to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"ty